  "solution": "The logic followed here is : **(1st number × 3rd number) + 3rd number = 2nd number**\n\nGiven :\n\n__\n \n• (8, 540, 60)\n\n​**8 × 60**__ + 60 = 540\n\n__**480 + 60**__ = 540\n\n540 = 540 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (9, 70, 7)​\n\n​9 × 7__ + 7 = 70\n\n__63 + 7__ = 70\n\n70 = 70 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : (12, 56, 60)​\n\n12 × 60__ + 60 = 56\n\n__720 + 60__ = 56\n\n**780 ≠ 56 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : (8, 63, 7)\n\n8 × 7__ + 7 = 63\n\n__56 + 7__ = 63\n\n**63 = 63 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : (9, 54, 12)\n\n9 × 12__ + 12 = 54\n\n__108 + 12__ = 54\n\n**120 ≠ 54 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : (9, 45, 7)​\n\n9 × 7__ + 7 = 45\n\n__63 + 7__ = 45\n\n**70 ≠ 45 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, **\"Option - (2)\"** is the correct answer.\n\na4:T143b",
